{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/lotos_1072x128.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the Path to Liberation in this mindfulness-themed idle/incremental game inspired by\u00a0Buddhist philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate the Four Divine Abidings: Loving-Kindness (<i>Metta</i>), Compassion (<i>Karuna</i>), Appreciative Joy (<i>Mudita</i>), and Equanimity (<i>Upekkha</i>) - and apply them in various encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/7__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a calm atmosphere supported by hand-painted art and relaxing music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely choose between active and idle playstyles, with fair offline progress upgradeable to up to 52 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/4__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your entire journey will be guided by a series of tasks that gradually introduce core concepts. With dedication, you can complete the game through a series of Rebirths, shaped by the Karma Seeds sown in previous incarnations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/6__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover optional lore and unlock themed Skills, Insights, and Spiritual\u202fTools as you progress along the Path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/huge_8__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sow karma seeds to shape each rebirth and experience the journey in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each step you make brings you closer towards the ultimate goal of Full Liberation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655580?t=1746596375","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/fba35fa058be5cb789ef556f33776bef5361a1dd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746596375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/5706dcf4a3bf7bae4bb2563e19098cda0547fc59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746596375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/5706dcf4a3bf7bae4bb2563e19098cda0547fc59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746596375","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/lotos_1072x128.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the Path to Liberation in this mindfulness-themed idle/incremental game inspired by\u00a0Buddhist philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate the Four Divine Abidings: Loving-Kindness (<i>Metta</i>), Compassion (<i>Karuna</i>), Appreciative Joy (<i>Mudita</i>), and Equanimity (<i>Upekkha</i>) - and apply them in various encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/7__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a calm atmosphere supported by hand-painted art and relaxing music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely choose between active and idle playstyles, with fair offline progress upgradeable to up to 52 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/4__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your entire journey will be guided by a series of tasks that gradually introduce core concepts. With dedication, you can complete the game through a series of Rebirths, shaped by the Karma Seeds sown in previous incarnations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/6__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover optional lore and unlock themed Skills, Insights, and Spiritual\u202fTools as you progress along the Path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/extras/huge_8__Large_.png?t=1746596375\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sow karma seeds to shape each rebirth and experience the journey in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each step you make brings you closer towards the ultimate goal of Full Liberation.</p>","developers":["Vladlen Manshin"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655580/1067f0324b98eced37bcfbfb23035b3056300fb0/header.jpg?t=1746596375","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131233,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131233/movie480.mp4?t=1746596373","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131233/movie_max.mp4?t=1746596373"},"name":"Four Divine Abidings","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131233/e8c9706e97ed570940227950fdce09e1d50d22fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746596373","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131233/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746596373","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131233/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=174